==English==

===Etymology===
From [[w:Pashto|Pashto]] {{PSchar|[[طالبان]]}} ("students" or "seekers"), a Pashto plural of Arabic {{ARchar|[[طالب]]}} ("seeker", "student").

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
'''Taliban'''[[Category:English nouns that lack inflection template]]

# {{Islam}} a [[Sunni]] [[Islamic]] [[student]] [[movement]] in [[Afghanistan]]; organized in 1994 by the [[radical]] [[mullah]] "Mohammad Omar"
# a Taliban [[militia]]

